  "description": "Dive into Heads Up! - available for free download and straightforward installation. Completely secure with no threats or malware. Enjoy quick access to the most recent version.",
  "editor_review": "Prepare yourself for an incredible party gaming adventures with Heads Up! This fantastic app, developed by Ellen DeGeneres, is essential for any game night or gathering. Featuring amusing categories such as celebrities, accents, and films, you’ll be laughing all the way as you guess the word displayed on your forehead. The app also lets you form custom categories and capture your gameplay to share with others. Whether you’re enjoying it in person or online, Heads Up! is the ultimate game to ensure endless entertainment!",
  "how_to_play": [
    "Select a category deck",
    "Position your phone on your forehead like a headband",
    "Guess the word based on your friends' hints",
    "Tilt your head to skip or guess correctly",
    "Capture your funny gameplay and share it"
